## 2. Tested Execution Flow

```text
First-Time Visitor / Fresh Entry (Unauthenticated)
                    │
                    ▼
          ┌───────────────────┐
          │ EntryWelcomePage  │  (Root /)
          └─────────┬─────────┘
                    │
        ┌───────────┴───────────┐
        ▼                       ▼
    [ TOURIST ]             [ VENDOR ]
  Pick: EN or HI       Pick: EN, HI, or BHO
        │                       │
        ▼                       ▼
   setLanguage()           setLanguage()
        │                       │
        ▼                       ▼
   Redirect: /             Redirect: /vendor/local-dashboard
(Homepage in chosen lang)  (Artisan Portal in chosen lang)
```

